note Test inputs
text doc_pos_a "title: Omega Pure Stack\nlicense: Apache-2.0\n# Main Title\n## Section Two\nSee [Omega](https://interplane.io/omega/).\n```omega\n# Not a heading\n[Ignored](https://interplane.io/ignored)\n```\n"
